### Signup User (Hostel Owner / Admin / Staff / Resident)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hostel Admin",
  "email": "admin@atithiaavas.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "hostelId": 1,
  "role": "OWNER"
}

### Signup Request with Validation Failure Test
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login Request (Success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@atithiaavas.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login Request with Bad Credentials (Failure Test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@atithiaavas.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Get Current Authenticated User Profile (via HTTP-Only Cookie or Bearer Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
# Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### Logout Request (Clears HTTP-Only Cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
